<title>USA: Singapore allows Mid Ocean to open branch.</title>
<headline>Singapore allows Mid Ocean to open branch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Signapore has given Mid Ocean Ltd permission to open a branch office in the country to market and underwrite its business in East Asia, excluding Japan.</p>
<p>Mid Ocean said Wednesday the Monetary Authority of Singapore had given it formal approval to open the office.</p>
<p>The branch office, which would also underwrite general reinsurance business, would begin operating by January 1997, it said.</p>
<p>Mid Ocean Ltd, through its wholly owned subsidiary, Mid Ocean Reinsurance Company Ltd, is a reinsurer.</p>
</text>
